<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>关于北京打卡攻略</title>
    <style>
        * {
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        body {
            background-color: #fdbbe4;
            font-family: "Microsoft YaHei", "PingFang SC", "Helvetica Neue", sans-serif;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 20px 10px;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            color: #111;
        }

        .container {
            width: 100%;
            max-width: 600px;
        }

        .header {
            text-align: center;
            font-size: 44px;
            font-weight: 900;
            margin-top: 15px;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            letter-spacing: 1px;
        }

        .header .red-text {
            color: #d1121c;
        }

        .header .black-text {
            color: #111;
        }

        .divider {
            border: none;
            border-top: 5px solid #222;
            margin: 0 10px 25px 10px;
        }

        .section {
            margin-bottom: 30px;
            padding: 0 10px;
        }

        .section-title {
            font-size: 20px;
            font-weight: bold;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
            letter-spacing: 0.5px;
        }

        .icon-check {
            display: inline-flex;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
            width: 22px;
            height: 22px;
            background-color: #0dc964;
            border-radius: 4px;
            margin-right: 8px;
        }

        .list-item {
            display: flex;
            align-items: flex-start;
            margin-bottom: 8px;
            font-size: 15px;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }

        .number-icon {
            display: inline-flex;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
            flex-shrink: 0;
            width: 18px;
            height: 18px;
            background-color: #27b6f6;
            color: #fff;
            font-size: 13px;
            font-weight: bold;
            border-radius: 2px;
            margin-right: 6px;
            margin-top: 3px;
        }

        .star-icon {
            flex-shrink: 0;
            color: #f26f21;
            font-size: 16px;
            margin-right: 6px;
            margin-top: 1px;
        }

        .highlight {
            text-decoration: underline;
            text-decoration-color: #e51c23;
            text-decoration-thickness: 1px;
            text-underline-offset: 3px;
        }

        .text {
            flex-grow: 1;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="container">
    <div class="header">
        <span class="red-text">关于北京打卡</span><span class="black-text">攻略</span>
    </div>

    <hr class="divider">

    <div class="section">
        <div class="section-title">
            <span class="icon-check">
                <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="white" stroke-width="4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"></polyline></svg>
            </span>
            怎么到北京
        </div>

        <div class="list-item">
            <span class="number-icon">1</span>
            <span class="text"><span class="highlight">北京机场：</span>首都国际机场/大兴国际机场，其中首都国际机场离市区比较近，机场都有公交/地铁/大巴到市区</span>
        </div>
        <div class="list-item">
            <span class="number-icon">2</span>
            <span class="text"><span class="highlight">首都国际机场：</span>距离市区约20km，地铁机场线可直达</span>
        </div>
        <div class="list-item">
            <span class="number-icon">3</span>
            <span class="text"><span class="highlight">大兴国际机场：</span>离市区约47km，地铁机场线可以直达</span>
        </div>
        <div class="list-item">
            <span class="number-icon">4</span>
            <span class="text"><span class="highlight">火车站：</span>有5个火车站，其中北京南站、北京站、北京西站是高铁站，建议选高铁</span>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="section">
        <div class="section-title">
            <span class="icon-check">
                <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="white" stroke-width="4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"></polyline></svg>
            </span>
            北京市内交通
        </div>

        <div class="list-item">
            <span class="number-icon">1</span>
            <span class="text"><span class="highlight">北京乘车码：</span>可下载或者ZFB搜索【北京一卡通】和【亿通行】乘坐公交地铁，均可扫码支付，乘车有优惠。</span>
        </div>
        <div class="list-item">
            <span class="number-icon">2</span>
            <span class="text"><span class="highlight">公交：</span>部分公交线路，以分段式收费，上下车都要扫码；公交卡1元，ZFB可能有优惠；投币2元</span>
        </div>
        <div class="list-item">
            <span class="number-icon">3</span>
            <span class="text"><span class="highlight">地铁：</span>3元起步价按里程收费，最高7元，5点-23点有车</span>
        </div>
        <div class="list-item">
            <span class="number-icon">4</span>
            <span class="text"><span class="highlight">打车：</span>出租车3公里内起步价14元，超出2.3元/公里，夜间加20%网约车建议到商圈/车站500米外再定位叫车</span>
        </div>
        <div class="list-item">
            <span class="number-icon">5</span>
            <span class="text"><span class="highlight">汽车：</span>北京的汽车站超级多，离北京近的可以坐汽车，远的就不推荐了，另外晕车的小伙伴记得备好晕车药</span>
        </div>
        <div class="list-item">
            <span class="number-icon">6</span>
            <span class="text"><span class="highlight">共享电动车：</span>10公里内建议，车多人多注意安全，但是天安门广场附近的区域是不让进的</span>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="section">
        <div class="section-title">
            <span class="icon-check">
                <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="white" stroke-width="4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"></polyline></svg>
            </span>
            北京6-8月天气
        </div>

        <div class="list-item">
            <span class="star-icon">&#9733;</span>
            <span class="text">6月平均温度是21°C ~ 32°C</span>
        </div>
        <div class="list-item">
            <span class="star-icon">&#9733;</span>
            <span class="text">7月平均温度是23°C ~ 32°C</span>
        </div>
        <div class="list-item">
            <span class="star-icon">&#9733;</span>
            <span class="text">8月平均温度是21°C ~ 32°C</span>
        </div>
        <div class="list-item">
            <span class="star-icon">&#9733;</span>
            <span class="text">建议穿搭：穿棉麻面料的衬衫、薄长裙、薄T恤，早晚有温差，带上套装、夹衣、风衣、休闲装、夹克衫、西装、薄毛衣等衣服</span>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>

</body>
</html>
